<title>USA: Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Oklahoma feedlot cattle roundup  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderate in the panhandle area late Thursday. Slaughter steers and heifers closed steady.</p>
<p>Feedlots reported moderate inquiry from buyers. Sales reported on 6,200 slaughter steers and 800 heifers; 89,000 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 15,000 formulated cattle and 1,900 previously contracted cattle to be shipped this week.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1100-1250 lbs 69.00.</p>
<p>Select, few choice 2-3 1100-1200 lbs 68.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1000-1150 lbs 69.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed:     7,000    Week Ago:  79,300     Year Ago: 49,100</p>
<p>Wk to Date:   89,000    Week Ago:  95,900     Year Ago: 64,400</p>
